  "data": {
    "content": {
      "title": "会用 AI 做图，已经不够了（分享 3 个牛逼设计 skill）",
      "nick_name": "苍何",
      "author": "苍何",
      "user_name": "gh_fdb597c42fa4",
      "desc": "",
      "content_noencode": "<center><span style=\"background:#d3f8b6;\"><span leaf=\"\">这是苍何的第 588 篇原创！</span></span></center><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">大家好，我是苍何。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">最近不少人夸我的视频号封面做的好看。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaCpTfY6jxunK7jVIoa2WMdicZMfOQ5eHSJjicMu7rCNMVbUN7b5f7HEWp8soXvUY6fs0cC3vKIaeichRsddEnnxP33CcHGWKSNyl0/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.8187565858798735\" data-w=\"949\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">然后后台也收到了不少留言，问我的开源网站是怎么设计出来的。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaDyLkIx72SBhSAujnrFOgche3YicAO5lFMBNapVjb9KZr87svQ4AqGaLia9icG6ebjVZBciakCmQJHSnVDRtWmYBjLzxBcE3iaIEFhk/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6777777777777778\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">以前我用 AI 做设计，总想着换个更强的模型、找段更牛的 Prompt，最好一句话直接出图。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">可用得越久越发现，</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(46, 167, 101);font-weight: 700;\"><span leaf=\"\">做出一张好看的图，只是第一步。</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">参考去哪里找、风格怎么定、第一版出来后怎么改，最后能不能真正拿去用，这些环节能不能顺畅地串起来，才真正决定了最终效果。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">所以这篇，我就结合最近做的几个项目，聊聊自己现在是怎么做设计的，也把 3 个用着不错的设计 Skill 分享出来。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这套流程，我目前主要在 Lovart 里完成。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">我大噶看了下，我已经分享过关于 Lovart 的文章不下 10 篇了。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">去年 5 月它刚火出圈时，我费劲拿到内测码，连着玩了两天，写了第一篇实测。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">然后就一直没停下来，我现在很多的设计工作是在 Lovart 完成的，比如海报设计、封面制作等。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaAZnWMnDmV9M4hGsdU1icKVmssBaBKcoPU8BvpvSonhJibdLTI3sWqP9Sd4rNjRjwMv7bt8JwCiaoat7HSgjf9bXA4VtOu1wNMEE4/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.0460358056265984\" data-w=\"782\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">我看这次 Lovart 的又做了不少更新，把重点放在了设计工作流本身，带来灵感直连、专业 skill 等能力。</span></p><blockquote style=\"margin: 20px 0px;padding: 10px 20px;color: rgb(44, 62, 80);background-color: rgb(240, 253, 244);border-left: 4px solid rgb(66, 185, 131);border-radius: 4px;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.6;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;padding: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\">之前网络不好的时候用着感觉总是卡卡的，现在终于做了国内版了：lovart.art</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">我在 Lovart 上也直接搞了个 skill，可以根据文章主旨快速直出想要的封面图，比如这个就是我直接借助 Lovart skill 出来的封面图。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaAgPVKQTUBxsMQopcgUNbVAcInCZW1asaVumic14gy9WReRVCboVLhzLn4v7ib4pIgFiavXBSuoqbtV1eqPmQwzPQQjK2JhThMLc0/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.3333333333333333\" data-w=\"768\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">之前做了个 Codex 的换肤应用，很多人说我的皮肤做的不错，其实不少之前是先通过 Lovart 做设计，然后放到应用中生成的。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaDUFL2iaGp8yyvEYFqIzGmYQa5OenkvTviaGZAqEV0YTaQYMsHeekBgkQficicHGRS4ZyIPxt9HofibQlf1b0qAdguN2mn1kgcicepxA/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6907407407407408\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">我现在把这个 codex 皮肤的能力直接提炼为了 skill，然后放在了 Lovart 上，生成主题皮肤设计图，变得如此丝滑。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaCu9k5GhDshiaEfw6wXAfERzStBxFQiaSwESn88XCAJ1Im1icKwj6pSwSCcLN7OTNBxmoSb4jCEtgemTBV88JzBozpicuhUic3lic4KE/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5712962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaCicnbiagbjKZ9Qcx8j2aVfNwS4ACde82mZgsSpxfiaQicpjqLy88A1iaJCTiaq9fekANpEVMDL9t4kz1yn8EcH3q49WnVvNEIEFEMiaY/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5712962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaBKsl2JnB3OR04aOibr1AcQon5gpCa6uJnI8iaBbzrjC2DPgSEvib8h0BzETUBsQMMLSv1bUoicx6VJtLtVKYcH9cH6Ra8a564HIBI/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5712962962962963\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">然后导入 Codex Theme 应用，就能换上自己喜欢的皮肤啦。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaBNvPGjC7Gtib19v2BsKA0c3AYFricZibpmpJF9tSmKbk4kPGGibfx0Wn66qgrwo8jpogFBDkDh8ibYj90ZyV0pgrOCIHqUlAhibWLjI/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.7777777777777778\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">我的 gpt-image-2 开源项目这几天在 GitHub 直接就起飞了，登顶趋势榜第一给我带来了很多的 star，现在也 25.5 k 了。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaAibyd0TV6ZC5P0f9mZzdCIr7QhhEJzdtEy5DK51Nib0qzn4F1cqckQXfrKDh33DLpDlqHaoExzEtw2hdLlyOfjTAiaVBRib9Xp7dw/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.30092592592592593\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">你不知道，我现在把这个 skill 放在了 Lovart 是有多爽，设计变得更为丝滑了，从参考图的生成到改图都更方便了。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">比如这张图就是借助 Lovart 配合 skill 生成的桂林水彩拼贴旅行海报。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaDtmEj6uBpqH3nJyfibMjnJhK6Ake6sreB1ZNy5gHIn9pYQF5dibgped017liawbOMTlPZ11dhUP3hD5b8v9icdHbqVIVvWOqtKyr8/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.4883720930232558\" data-w=\"688\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">而这张图的参考是 skill 自动用的我开源项目里这个 case 的提示词：</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaDzVicOyVoxTCHtqvgzThvWNicQZOTVrfz9icR7JLOdTUxp7XzC4KEicCBfKriaAC7EpJscw3zb4EbML3V5uEvXCzQ3mp2E3CFNGUBc/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.7833333333333333\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><blockquote style=\"margin: 20px 0px;padding: 10px 20px;color: rgb(44, 62, 80);background-color: rgb(240, 253, 244);border-left: 4px solid rgb(66, 185, 131);border-radius: 4px;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.6;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;padding: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\">我也把这几个 skill 都放到了 lovart，大家直接就能使用了，你最感兴趣哪个，也可以评论区告诉我。</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">做动态海报我看之前一堆人分享教程还挺麻烦的，现在我在 Lovart 中借助动态海报 skill，就很快能做带有音乐的动态海报了。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">现在 Lovart 不再只能生成图片了，现在</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(46, 167, 101);font-weight: 700;\"><span leaf=\"\">支持单图、组图、Motion 动效、视频、可运行 HTML 网页和 PPT 等多种设计产物。</span></strong></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4673634981380718595\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4673634981380718595\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fzw8bZHsVSaDma0llEKQooEicpcnyLF7tjLdC61FiaCbKndYSQQZosmEQmCHdcHtUhGTh5aYsN1n8Om6mJIgz4BpxP8xicn4A5xjdjLdb13fetQ%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-w=\"720\"></iframe></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">我还借助 Lovart skill，快速产出公众号有意思的配图，比如这种手帐插画的配图就非常有意思：</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaB2icvsvppiaSUYlTRic4kcoX4oMTETcwxUYmgyjXic94goDDgmT85h5n8acZT7OJMNyxGbFSSiaxdVeUDXc7m7EY7eof00eKa19u1E/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1\" data-w=\"1024\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">然后把这张插图放到文章中，比干突突的 AI 生成的图多少还是有些不一样。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaDphNrT06adhibibDdesicicMtoft6dVJo6EF4SrrMs59nS2aPZOHyDtlvcl0nbVKDkujcdjroDbibUmqC9MJjkzd1VUOCpGZJWCbCk/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.9712643678160919\" data-w=\"1044\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">现在产品设计的前期工作也可以直接在 Lovart 中进行，比如 APP 的设计图。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaAcfMwrxBmbWQURMr2BibRxQgrVhouRShBGWLoeZseYLKWOkRLUhMK6icoDyLtzJsw5ZRfSzhib2LxmbfGBwheGRicUfKV7St6fWO4/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5592592592592592\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">清新简约的设计，还是非常不错的。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaDbcHTnH7xIa93RGLic8jmNf3xVtib9M2p4944DkEwtQVWFf3yCS9yPtU4iaicXNgmRsVEJUvmphoOnXCicL1oEGRjGVbia21uPibJ1WA/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5592592592592592\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"display: block;max-width: 100%;height: auto;margin: 20px auto 30px;border-radius: 6px;object-fit: contain;box-shadow: rgb(153, 153, 153) 2px 4px 7px;\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><p style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">我还借助极简抽象 logo 这个 skill，我可以把实物快速的变为极简抽象 logo，还挺有意思的。</span></p><section style=\"margin: 30px 8px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangSC-light;font-size: 16px;line-height: 32px;letter-spacing: 2px;word-spacing: 2px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/zw8bZHsVSaCvicmcQXcRFOHpdqVbELdXoMpX1us1nM97IhEGsvM9wMYA6WcfiadSIlViaQ5nPHZ3uENLAv4RwYYdHvPg5Qgmw4OjJsEXbjMjKE/640?from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\